  m_text: "1. 3D Model Rotation\r\nUse the Left (\u2190) and Right (\u2192) Arrow
    Keys to rotate the chest organ model. Buttons are also provided for quick Front,
    Back, Right, and Left side views.\r\n\r\nRest Button: Resets the view to the
    original front perspective.\r\n\r\n2. Organ Selection & Details\r\nClick to highlight
    an organ. Please select only one organ to proceed.\r\n\r\n[Space]: Enter the
    \"Organ details\" view for the selected organ.\r\n\r\n[Escape]: Exit the \"Organ
    details\" view."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 817113b8cb5de3145817c278285a3e47, type: 2}
